@LarFinanceApi = http://localhost:5080

### Saúde da API
GET {{LarFinanceApi}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Lista pessoas
GET {{LarFinanceApi}}/api/people
Accept: application/json

### Cria uma pessoa
POST {{LarFinanceApi}}/api/people
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Souza",
  "age": 27
}

### Lista transações
GET {{LarFinanceApi}}/api/transactions
Accept: application/json

### Cria uma transação (substitua personId)
POST {{LarFinanceApi}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Supermercado",
  "amount": 245.90,
  "type": "Expense",
  "personId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Consulta totais
GET {{LarFinanceApi}}/api/totals
Accept: application/json
